  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging Citizens, Empowering Communities - East Europe Foundation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Engaging Citizens, Empowering Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det syftar till att st&#xe4;rka det civila samh&#xe4;llet i Moldavien f&#xf6;r    att fr&#xe4;mja en demokratisk utveckling. EEF &#xe4;mnar bidra till &#xf6;kat       inflytande i beslutsfattande processer genom att st&#xe4;rka deltagandet i lokala kommuner, genom att bla fr&#xe4;mja professionell och kvalitativ    media, transparata och fria val, bemyndiga unga medborgare. EEF       beviljas k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d pga god intern styrning och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga uppn&#xe5; resultat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to strengthen CSO in Moldova to  promote democratic development. EEF contributes to increased          influence in decision-making processes by enhancing participation in  local communities, by promote qualitative media, transparent &amp; free   elections, empower young citizens etc. EEF awarded core support       because of good internal control &amp; ability to achieve results.</narrative>
  </description>
